# Trial by Lightning (otherAreas 27): completed by GM (TrialByLightning_date 0), the fork by GM: the battlefield's
# entry holds for a completed quest (status >= accepted), and 32001's finish gives the title and the Whisper of Storms
# in any status (kept Lua quirk; battlefieldWin is not read). Ripapa: available (a GM) at fame level 1 with the
# whisper: 10020; completed by GM (date 0): 10016, whose option 1 deletes and begins it; accepted with the whisper:
# 10019. The win while available is #battlefield_available (a second entry in this flow would land in the won arena,
# which the char has not left).
char zone=CloisterOfStorms pos=533.5,-14.9,492.0 job=WAR lvl=75
quest OtherAreas.TrialByLightning completed
keyitem TuningForkOfLightning
login
trigger LP_Entrance                       # completed, the fork: the entry menu 32000
update 32000 option=1                     # registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                    # in the arena
kill LIGHTNING_GREMLIN-3                  # the battlefield won, 32001 opens (canSkipCS 1)
finish                                    # completed: Heir of the Great Lightning, the Whisper of Storms all the same
warp 30.6,-15.6,56.0 Mhaura
quest OtherAreas.TrialByLightning available
trigger Ripapa                            # available, fame level 1, the whisper: 10020
finish
quest OtherAreas.TrialByLightning completed
trigger Ripapa                            # completed, TrialByLightning_date 0 behind: 10016
finish option=1                           # the quest deleted and begun; the fork
trigger Ripapa                            # accepted, the whisper: 10019
finish option=4                           # the Elder Branch: completed
